# What this image is expected to contain. Checked at build time by
# restaurant/patches/assert_pins.py — a mismatch fails the bake loudly rather
# than shipping a silently different app.
#
# hrms is held at v16.5.0 deliberately: from v16.5.1 its installer writes to
# Accounts Settings.repost_allowed_types, a field erpnext v16.6.0 does not have,
# and the install dies with AttributeError. Moving hrms up means moving erpnext
# up first and re-testing the till.
#
# erpnext and hrms are pinned to real tags. erpnext-restaurant has NO tags
# upstream and bench clones with --branch, which will not take a bare SHA, so
# master is asserted instead. To convert that into a true pin: fork
# alphabit-technology/erpnext-restaurant, tag this commit, and point
# apps-restaurant.json at the fork + tag.
erpnext=v16.6.0
hrms=v16.5.0
restaurant_management=c55ac4ae84810be445b4895089516e12a299ba9a
